              "message": "Merge dds-import-options into dds-extended-formats\n\nPicks up the capped mip count in info() beside the new compression() and\nsrgb fields, and upstream main via P1 (DocumentFormat import refactor).\n\nGenerated with [Devin](https://devin.ai)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Devin <158243242+devin-ai-integration[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>",
              "url": "https://github.com/Blenux/photocraft/commit/0c647d18b60a4f2e83393966d5ec794a7ff2ade1",
